**Nucleolar NPM1 integrated intensity did not change consistently with ActD 1 µM.**

We quantified nucleolar NPM1 integrated intensity in [Cell line] cells ([treatment and duration]) labelled with [antibody or dye for each stain]. Small dots show individual nucleoli, coloured by run; large symbols show the value of each run (the mean of its fields, each field summarised by the median of its nucleoli); lines join the same run; horizontal lines show the mean of runs. n = 3 runs per condition; 281 (Untreated) and 307 (ActD 1 µM) nucleoli from 9 fields per condition; individual nucleoli and fields are not treated as independent replicates. Per-run changes of ActD 1 µM relative to Untreated: +1,186% (Rep1), +105% (Rep2) and −91% (Rep3). No hypothesis test or confidence interval was calculated because the independence of the runs was not confirmed.
